            {
              "id": "cm0zl1h8y003c356utta3q4ku",
              "heading": "<p><strong>Module 1: Understanding AI </strong></p>",
              "paragraph": "<p>This module introduces the course \"Responsible AI for Public Sector Professionals: Scaling AI in your organization\" and provides an overview of the key topics covered, including different AI approaches, selecting impactful projects, ensuring data quality, developing AI talent, and navigating ethical considerations and risk management practices. The module emphasizes the potential of AI to revolutionize public sector operations and the importance of government leaders making informed decisions about AI implementation while maintaining public trust.<br class=\"break-when-trailing\"><br class=\"break-when-trailing\">After each video ends, a continue button appears below the video player. Click it to reveal the additional navigation and the InnovateUS website link containing readings and resources. Learners with screen readers can use the down arrow key to navigate through the video player’s controls and access the continue button. <strong><em>Another</em></strong> “continue” button will appear to move on to the Self-Assessments after each video.</p><ul><li><p><strong>Reminder:</strong> Consult with your organization’s policies before using any tool or platform. &nbsp;</p></li><li><p><strong>Disclaimer</strong>: The commercial tools mentioned in this course are for illustrative purposes and do not imply endorsement by InnovateUS.</p></li></ul>"
            }
          ],
